  _projectName: Flash of light
  _thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9b687cc607115ab4ea1f31dd04cc09d9, type: 3}
  _videoDemoLink: https://github.com/AndrejKubik/InteractivePortfolio/releases/download/demo-videos/Flash.of.Light.mp4
  _descriptionText: "Top-down exploration horror game where you wake up in a dark
    and quiet forest with no memory, a flashlight, and a rather talkative ghost companion.\r\n\r\n-
    While you explore your surroundings, you often get chased by terrifying monsters.
    These monsters are weak to strong light so your only means of fighting back is
    to point your flashlight at them to turn them to dust over a short time. Be careful
    though, if you move the flashlight off of them they will regenerate quickly and
    make sure your battery doesn\u2019t run out!"
  _developmentHighlights:
  - Name: 
    Text: Top-Down movement and aim
  - Name: 
    Text: Realistic flashlight cone effect with a hitbox for damaging monsters
  - Name: 
    Text: Character animations with blend trees and animation rigging
  - Name: 
    Text: Character animations with blend trees and animation rigging
  - Name: 
    Text: Map system with landmarks, which trigger narrator voice lines
